Here are three educational documents, listed in ascending order of
complexity.


# ((What Is Lojban?, The Book|What Is Lojban?)), an introductory book covering a wide range of basic information on the lojban language.
#  Robin Turner and Nick Nicholas's [http://ptolemy.tlg.uci.edu/~opoudjis/lojbanbrochure/lessons/book1.html|Lojban For Beginners] lessons.
#  The [http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/|jbovlaste dictionary interface,] a way to browse and enter lojban word definitions.
    
Finally, you can [http://www.lojban.org/lsg2/|join the beginner's Lojban list].
